    \\"HABP2\\",\\n 73|             \\"TRAF3IP1\\",\\n 74|             \\"TBC1D8B\\",\\n 75|             \\"HFM1\\",\\n 76|             \\"C5orf58\\",\\n 77|             \\"KLHL33\\",\\n 78|             \\"GMFB\\",\\n 79|             \\"SLC5A2\\",\\n 80|             \\"NID1\\",\\n 81|             \\"CD33\\",\\n 82|             \\"ATP5MG\\",\\n 83|             \\"SPATA25\\",\\n 84|             \\"CLASP1\\",\\n 85|             \\"SCGB3A2\\",\\n 86|             \\"CLEC3A\\",\\n 87|             \\"EVI5L\\",\\n 88|             \\"MANF\\",\\n 89|             \\"TIPIN\\",\\n 90|             \\"CT45A7\\",\\n 91|             \\"SPDYE1\\",\\n 92|             \\"POGZ\\",\\n 93|             \\"ZNF43\\",\\n 94|             \\"ASTE1\\",\\n 95|             \\"RSL24D1\\",\\n 96|             \\"RPS6KA2\\",\\n 97|             \\"LINGO3\\",\\n 98|             \\"ZNF432\\",\\n 99|             \\"S1PR5\\",\\n100|             \\"ARL10\\","\n}'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "Now let me analyze the evolution history to understand the patterns. Let me create a summary of what I've learned:\n", 'tool_calls': [{'id': 'call_80c75a043f124067a67413fe', 'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'write_todos', 'arguments': '{"todos": [{"description": "Analyze evolution history and identify patterns", "status": "completed"}, {"description": "Design a novel exploration strategy for candidate_5", "status": "in_progress"}, {"description": "Copy current best harness to candidate_5 output directory", "status": "pending"}, {"description": "Implement the targeted modification to model.py", "status": "pending"}, {"description": "Write proposer_reasoning.md explaining the change", "status": "pending"}]}'}}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'call_80c75a043f124067a67413fe', 'content': '{\n  "content": "Successfully updated the todo list. The current list is now:\\n1. [completed] Analyze evolution history and identify patterns\\n2. [in_progress] Design a novel exploration strategy for candidate_5\\n3. [pending] Copy current best harness to candidate_5 output directory\\n4. [pending] Implement the targeted modification to model.py\\n5. [pending] Write proposer_reasoning.md explaining the change"\n}'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': "Based on my analysis of the evolution history:\n\n**Key Observations:**\n1. **Progressive Improvement**: Scores have improved from 10.53 → 14.93 → 18.08 → 20.41\n2. **Strategy Evolution**: \n   - Candidate 1: Introduced Thompson Sampling with gene search (30% similar genes when hits exist)\n   - Candidate 2: Added diverse gene search (40% diverse genes when no hits)\n   - Candidate 3: Increased diverse exploration to 60%\n   - Candidate 4: Reduced diverse exploration to 45% (better balance)\n3. **Recent Strategy Tags**: ['feature', 'uncertainty'] (gene search features + Thompson Sampling uncertainty)\n4. **Explore Mode**: This is a scheduled exploration round - need a meaningfully different approach\n\n**Novel Strategy Proposal:**\nI'll implement a **score-based adaptive bandit strategy** that:\n- Uses actual score values directly (not just hit/miss binary)\n- Adapts exploration based on score distribution statistics\n- Introduces a **gradient-based** approach to select genes\n- This is a NEW strategy tag: 'gradient' or 'direct_optimization'\n\nLet me copy the current best and implement this change:\n", 'tool_calls': [{'id': 'call_247a1f96110147d6b39b4461', 'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'run_shell_command', 'arguments': '{"command": "cp -r /inspire/qb-ilm/project/cq-scientific-cooperation-zone/public/ywang/meta-harness-evolver/project/test/project-bda/hoss-evolution-workspaces/IFNG/run-2/best/current/harness /inspire/qb-ilm/project/cq-scientific-cooperation-zone/public/ywang/meta-harness-evolver/project/test/project-bda/hoss-evolution-workspaces/IFNG/run-2/candidates/candidate_5/", "description": "Copy current best harness to candidate_5 directory"}'}}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'call_247a1f96110147d6b39b4461', 'con